# Field guns (2026-10-06, owner): a company of gunners - a gun for every five men - hauled forward
# until something is in range (about 400 m), then roundshot: at the enemy's fort walls first,
# else into the thickest of his companies. The gunners stand by their guns.
drill "Artillery"
about "Field guns, a gun for every five men: hauled forward until something is in range (about 400 m), then roundshot - at the enemy's fort walls first, else into the thickest of his companies. The gunners stand by their guns."
type Gunner
dials aggression 0.20 discipline 0.85 cohesion 0.80 cover 0.20 patience 0.90 nerve 0.70

sergeant:
  when enemy within 380                                -> hold; hold fire
  otherwise                                            -> advance slow; hold fire

man:
  when enemy within 6                                  -> bayonet
  otherwise                                            -> follow sergeant
